\f0\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 Business model\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs32 \cf2 Biography Library is a nonprofit association. We advertise only our own websites with Google Ad Grants. We do not run an agency and we do not manage ads for other organisations.\
Websites in scope:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 https://biographylibrary.org\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 https://app.biographylibrary.org (same organisation; ads land on the main site unless we change that later)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 A separate commercial activity (Brignole) has its own Google Ads accounts and its own developer token. This token will 
\f0\b not
\f2\b0  access those accounts. Grants spend and paid spend are never combined.\
The association\'92s public websites must not carry visitor-tracking scripts (no Google Analytics, Tag Manager, or ads pixels on the pages), by statute. Search Console is verified with DNS only. Conversion recording uses a first-party WordPress plugin that stores the Google click id from the landing URL when someone submits a contact form. No Google JavaScript is loaded on the site.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa287\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 Tool access / use\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs32 \cf2 The tool is 
\f0\b Regia SEO
\f2\b0 , a private panel for one operator.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 No public sign-ups. No third-party users. No agency access.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Reads campaign performance (impressions, clicks, CTR, keywords) once per night.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Prepares campaign 
\f1\i drafts
\f2\i0  in the panel. Live campaigns are created by hand in the Google Ads interface.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Does 
\f0\b not
\f2\b0  create, pause, enable, or mutate campaigns, ads, budgets, or keywords through the API.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Does upload 
\f0\b click conversions
\f2\b0  for form submissions that followed an ad click (gclid), using ConversionUploadService. No CSV is uploaded by hand.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 On first run, the tool may enable auto-tagging and create one conversion action of type UPLOAD_CLICKS if it is missing. That is the only other write.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 We apply for 
\f0\b Basic Access
\f2\b0 . The tool is not offered to other advertisers. Required Minimum Functionality does not apply.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa287\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 Tool design\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f2\b0\fs32 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 A scheduled job authenticates as a Google Cloud service account invited to the Biography Library manager / Grants client (Standard access, so conversion upload is allowed).\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Read: 
\f3\fs25\fsmilli12667 GoogleAdsService.Search
\f2\fs32  for campaign, campaign_budget, keyword_view, metrics.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Write (Grants only): 
\f3\fs25\fsmilli12667 uploadClickConversions
\f2\fs32  with gclid, conversion action, time, and a unique order id. Optional one-time 
\f3\fs25\fsmilli12667 mutateCustomer
\f2\fs32  (auto-tagging) and 
\f3\fs25\fsmilli12667 conversionActions.mutate
\f2\fs32  (create UPLOAD_CLICKS action).\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The UI at https://seo.brignole.ch/pubblicita/biography-library reads the database. It never calls mutate on campaigns.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa287\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 API services called\
